More intensive games like "The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom" may not be able to run on the third-generation &zwnj;Apple TV&zwnj; 4K because of thermal throttling. The fourth-generation &zwnj;Apple TV&zwnj; 4K that launches November 13 may be able to run titles the third-generation model can't.<br/>
<br/>
